{
  "Parts & Components": "部件与结构",
  "Micrometer Types": "千分尺类型",
  "Least Count": "最小分度值",
  "Zero Error": "零误差",
  "Reading Method": "读数方法",
  "Outside Micrometer": "外径千分尺",
  "External dimensions": "测外形尺寸",
  "<h3>Outside Micrometer</h3><p>The most common type, used to measure <strong>external dimensions</strong> — shaft diameters, plate thickness, wire gauge. Features an anvil, spindle, barrel (sleeve), thimble, and ratchet stop.</p><ul><li>Standard range: 0–25 mm (metric) or 0–1″ (imperial)</li><li>Available in sets: 0–25, 25–50, 50–75 mm etc.</li><li>LC: 0.01 mm (metric) or 0.001″ (imperial)</li></ul>": "<h3>外径千分尺</h3><p>最常见的一种，用来测<strong>外形尺寸</strong> — 轴径、板厚、线材直径。由测砧、测微螺杆、固定套筒、微分筒和棘轮组成。</p><ul><li>标准量程：0–25 mm（公制）或 0–1″（英制）</li><li>成套出售：0–25、25–50、50–75 mm 等</li><li>最小分度值：0.01 mm（公制）或 0.001″（英制）</li></ul>",
  "Inside Micrometer": "内径千分尺",
  "Internal dimensions": "测内孔尺寸",
  "<h3>Inside Micrometer</h3><p>Measures <strong>internal dimensions</strong> — bore diameters, slot widths, hole sizes. The jaws expand outward against the internal surface.</p><ul><li>Caliper type: small bores (5–30 mm)</li><li>Rod type: larger bores with extension rods</li><li>Reading technique is same as outside micrometer</li></ul>": "<h3>内径千分尺</h3><p>测<strong>内尺寸</strong> — 孔径、槽宽、孔的大小。量爪向外张开顶住内壁。</p><ul><li>卡尺式：小孔径（5–30 mm）</li><li>接杆式：配接长杆测更大孔径</li><li>读数方法与外径千分尺相同</li></ul>",
  "Depth Micrometer": "深度千分尺",
  "<h3>Depth Micrometer</h3><p>Measures <strong>depth of slots, steps, and holes</strong>. A flat base sits on the reference surface while the spindle drives a rod into the cavity.</p><ul><li>Base width: 63 mm or 100 mm</li><li>Interchangeable rods in 25 mm / 1&Prime; steps &mdash; the rod's base value <strong>adds</strong> to the scale reading</li><li>The sleeve is numbered <strong>backwards</strong>: the main scale value is the first number <em>hidden</em> by the thimble, not the last one revealed</li></ul><div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>This one is simulated.</strong> Set the <strong>Instrument</strong> pills to <strong>Depth</strong> in the controls bar to fit it, pick a rod, and read it for yourself.</div>": "<h3>深度千分尺</h3><p>测<strong>槽深、台阶高和孔深</strong>。平底座落在基准面上，测微螺杆把测杆送进空腔。</p><ul><li>底座宽度：63 mm 或 100 mm</li><li>接长杆按 25 mm / 1&Prime; 一档更换 &mdash; 测杆的基准值要<strong>加</strong>到刻度读数上</li><li>套筒是<strong>反向</strong>标注的：主尺读数是微分筒<em>盖住</em>的第一个数字，而不是露出的最后一个</li></ul><div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>本模拟器就有这一把。</strong>把控制栏里的 <strong>量具</strong> 切到 <strong>深度</strong>，选一根接长杆，自己读一遍。</div>",
  "Digital Micrometer": "数显千分尺",
  "Electronic display": "电子数字显示",
  "<h3>Digital Micrometer</h3><p>Uses an <strong>electronic encoder</strong> and LCD display for direct reading. Eliminates parallax and interpolation errors.</p><ul><li>Resolution: 0.001 mm (10× finer than mechanical)</li><li>Features: mm/inch toggle, zero-set, data output (SPC)</li><li>Battery-powered; requires careful handling</li></ul>": "<h3>数显千分尺</h3><p>用<strong>电子编码器</strong>加液晶屏直接显示读数，消除了视差和估读误差。</p><ul><li>分辨力：0.001 mm（比机械式细 10 倍）</li><li>功能：毫米/英寸切换、清零、数据输出（SPC）</li><li>电池供电；使用需当心</li></ul>",
  "0.01 mm LC": "0.01 mm 最小分度",
  "Metric 50-division": "公制 50 分度",
  "<h3>0.01 mm Least Count (Metric)</h3><p>The standard metric micrometer. Pitch = <strong>0.5 mm</strong>, thimble has <strong>50 divisions</strong>.</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = Pitch ÷ CSD = 0.5 mm ÷ 50 = <strong>0.01 mm</strong></div><p><strong>Example:</strong> MSR = 5.50 mm, CSR = 23<br>TR = 5.50 + (23 × 0.01) = <strong>5.73 mm</strong></p>": "<h3>0.01 mm 最小分度（公制）</h3><p>标准公制千分尺。螺距 <strong>0.5 mm</strong>，微分筒 <strong>50 个分度</strong>。</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 螺距 ÷ 分度数 = 0.5 mm ÷ 50 = <strong>0.01 mm</strong></div><p><strong>举例：</strong>MSR = 5.50 mm，CSR = 23<br>TR = 5.50 + (23 × 0.01) = <strong>5.73 mm</strong></p>",
  "0.001″ LC": "0.001″ 最小分度",
  "Imperial 25-division": "英制 25 分度",
  "<h3>0.001″ Least Count (Imperial)</h3><p>The standard imperial micrometer. Pitch = <strong>0.025″</strong> (40 TPI), thimble has <strong>25 divisions</strong>.</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = Pitch ÷ CSD = 0.025″ ÷ 25 = <strong>0.001″</strong></div><p><strong>Example:</strong> MSR = 0.275″, CSR = 14<br>TR = 0.275 + (14 × 0.001) = <strong>0.289″</strong></p>": "<h3>0.001″ 最小分度（英制）</h3><p>标准英制千分尺。螺距 <strong>0.025″</strong>（40 牙/英寸），微分筒 <strong>25 个分度</strong>。</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 螺距 ÷ 分度数 = 0.025″ ÷ 25 = <strong>0.001″</strong></div><p><strong>举例：</strong>MSR = 0.275″，CSR = 14<br>TR = 0.275 + (14 × 0.001) = <strong>0.289″</strong></p>",
  "1 mm × 100": "1 mm × 100",
  "Metric, no half-mm mark": "公制，无半毫米刻线",
  "<h3>1 mm Pitch, 100-Division Thimble</h3><p>The <em>same</em> least count as the usual metric micrometer, reached the other way round.</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = Pitch ÷ CSD = 1 mm ÷ 100 = <strong>0.01 mm</strong></div><p>Because the spindle advances a <strong>whole millimetre</strong> per turn, the sleeve carries <strong>only whole-millimetre graduations</strong> — there is no half-millimetre mark below the datum line at all.</p><p><strong>The same size, split two ways.</strong> A part measuring 5.73 mm reads:</p><dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>0.5 mm × 50</dt><dd>5.50 + (23 × 0.01)</dd><dt>1 mm × 100</dt><dd>5.00 + (73 × 0.01)</dd></dl><div class=\"pi-tip\">Switch between the two with the <strong>Screw</strong> pills and watch the barrel reading jump while the total stays put. Missing the half-millimetre mark — and reading 5.23 instead of 5.73 — is the commonest metric micrometer error there is; on this instrument it cannot happen.</div>": "<h3>1 mm 螺距、100 分度微分筒</h3><p>与常见的公制千分尺<em>同一个</em>最小分度值，只是走了另一条路。</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 螺距 ÷ 分度数 = 1 mm ÷ 100 = <strong>0.01 mm</strong></div><p>因为螺杆每转一圈前进<strong>整整 1 毫米</strong>，套筒上<strong>只有整毫米刻线</strong> — 基准线下方根本没有半毫米刻线。</p><p><strong>同一个尺寸，两种分法。</strong>一个 5.73 mm 的零件读作：</p><dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>0.5 mm × 50</dt><dd>5.50 + (23 × 0.01)</dd><dt>1 mm × 100</dt><dd>5.00 + (73 × 0.01)</dd></dl><div class=\"pi-tip\">两把螺杆落到同一个总读数上，变的只是两个刻度之间的分配。漏看半毫米刻线、把 5.73 读成 5.23，是公制千分尺最常犯的错误；在这把量具上它不可能发生。</div>",
  "LC Formula": "最小分度值公式",
  "General formula": "通用公式",
  "<h3>Least Count — General Formula</h3><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = Pitch ÷ Number of Circular Scale Divisions</div><p>Where:<br>• <strong>Pitch</strong> = distance spindle moves per full revolution<br>• <strong>CSD</strong> = number of divisions on the thimble</p><p>Metric: 0.5 mm ÷ 50 = 0.01 mm<br>Metric: 1 mm ÷ 100 = 0.01 mm<br>Imperial: 0.025″ ÷ 25 = 0.001″</p><p>Two different screws can reach the same least count — what changes is how the reading is <em>split</em> between the barrel and the thimble.</p>": "<h3>最小分度值 — 通用公式</h3><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 螺距 ÷ 微分筒分度数</div><p>其中：<br>• <strong>螺距</strong> = 螺杆每转一圈前进的距离<br>• <strong>CSD</strong> = 微分筒上的分度数</p><p>公制：0.5 mm ÷ 50 = 0.01 mm<br>公制：1 mm ÷ 100 = 0.01 mm<br>英制：0.025″ ÷ 25 = 0.001″</p><p>两种不同的螺杆可以达到同一个最小分度值 — 变化的是读数在套筒和微分筒之间<em>怎么分</em>。</p>",
  "0.001 mm LC": "0.001 mm 最小分度",
  "Vernier Micrometer": "游标千分尺",
  "<h3>Vernier Micrometer (0.001 mm)</h3><p>Adds a <strong>vernier scale</strong> on the barrel with 10 divisions to further subdivide the thimble reading by 10×.</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 0.01 mm ÷ 10 = <strong>0.001 mm</strong></div><p>Used in precision metrology labs where 0.01 mm is not sufficient. The vernier lines on the barrel indicate which thimble division is most closely aligned.</p>": "<h3>游标千分尺（0.001 mm）</h3><p>在套筒上再加一副 <strong>10 分度游标</strong>，把微分筒读数再细分 10 倍。</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 0.01 mm ÷ 10 = <strong>0.001 mm</strong></div><p>用于 0.01 mm 不够用的精密计量场合。套筒上的游标刻线指示出微分筒哪一格对得最准。</p>",
  "No Zero Error": "无零误差",
  "Perfect alignment": "完全对齐",
  "<h3>No Zero Error</h3><p>When the spindle closes onto the anvil, the <strong>thimble zero aligns exactly</strong> with the datum line, and the barrel zero mark is just visible at the thimble edge.</p><ul><li>Close jaws gently using the ratchet stop</li><li>Check: thimble 0 aligns with datum line</li><li>Check: barrel shows exactly 0.00 mm</li></ul>": "<h3>无零误差</h3><p>测微螺杆合拢到测砧上时，微分筒的<strong>零线正好对齐</strong>基准线，套筒上的零刻度刚好在微分筒边缘露出来。</p><ul><li>用棘轮轻轻合拢</li><li>检查：微分筒 0 与基准线对齐</li><li>检查：套筒读数正好是 0.00 mm</li></ul>",
  "Positive Error": "正零误差",
  "Thimble zero below datum": "微分筒零线在基准线下方",
  "<h3>Positive Zero Error</h3><p>When closed, the thimble zero is <strong>below the datum line</strong> (reading > 0). The micrometer over-reads.</p><div class=\"formula-box\">Corrected = Observed − Zero Error</div><p><strong>Example:</strong> Zero error = +0.03 mm. Observed = 5.76 mm.<br>Corrected = 5.76 − 0.03 = <strong>5.73 mm</strong>.</p>": "<h3>正零误差</h3><p>合拢时微分筒零线在基准线<strong>下方</strong>（读数 > 0），千分尺读数偏大。</p><div class=\"formula-box\">修正后 = 观测值 − 零误差</div><p><strong>举例：</strong>零误差 = +0.03 mm，观测读数 = 5.76 mm。<br>修正后 = 5.76 − 0.03 = <strong>5.73 mm</strong>。</p>",
  "Negative Error": "负零误差",
  "Thimble zero above datum": "微分筒零线在基准线上方",
  "<h3>Negative Zero Error</h3><p>When closed, the thimble zero is <strong>above the datum line</strong> (reading < 0). The micrometer under-reads.</p><div class=\"formula-box\">Corrected = Observed + |Zero Error|</div><p><strong>Example:</strong> Zero error = −0.02 mm (thimble shows 48).<br>ZE = −(50 − 48) × 0.01 = −0.02 mm.<br>Observed = 5.71 mm. Corrected = 5.71 + 0.02 = <strong>5.73 mm</strong>.</p>": "<h3>负零误差</h3><p>合拢时微分筒零线在基准线<strong>上方</strong>（读数 < 0），千分尺读数偏小。</p><div class=\"formula-box\">修正后 = 观测值 + |零误差|</div><p><strong>举例：</strong>零误差 = −0.02 mm（微分筒显示 48）。<br>ZE = −(50 − 48) × 0.01 = −0.02 mm。<br>观测读数 = 5.71 mm，修正后 = 5.71 + 0.02 = <strong>5.73 mm</strong>。</p>",
  "Zero Correction": "零误差修正",
  "How to correct": "如何修正",
  "<h3>Zero Error Correction</h3><ol><li>Close the spindle onto the anvil using the <strong>ratchet stop</strong>.</li><li>Read the thimble division aligned with the datum line.</li><li>If thimble reads 0 — no error.</li><li>If thimble reads a positive number (e.g., 3) — ZE = +3 × LC.</li><li>If thimble reads near max (e.g., 48 on 50-div) — ZE = −(50−48) × LC.</li><li>Apply: Corrected = Observed − ZE.</li></ol>": "<h3>零误差修正</h3><ol><li>用<strong>棘轮</strong>把测微螺杆合拢到测砧上。</li><li>读出与基准线对齐的微分筒格数。</li><li>若微分筒读数为 0 &mdash; 无零误差。</li><li>若读到正数（如 3） &mdash; ZE = +3 × LC。</li><li>若读到接近最大值（如 50 分度上的 48） &mdash; ZE = −(50−48) × LC。</li><li>代入：修正后 = 观测值 − ZE。</li></ol>",
  "Step 1: MSR": "第 1 步：MSR",
  "Main Scale Reading": "主尺读数",
  "<h3>Step 1 — Main Scale Reading (MSR)</h3><p>Look at the <strong>barrel scale</strong>. Count the whole millimetre (or 0.025″) marks <strong>exposed by the thimble edge</strong>. Pay special attention to the <strong>half-millimetre mark</strong> (SI) — if it's visible, add 0.5 mm to your reading.</p><p><strong>SI:</strong> MSR = whole mm + (0.5 if half-mm mark visible).<br><strong>Imperial:</strong> MSR = count of 0.025″ marks visible.</p>": "<h3>第 1 步 — 主尺读数（MSR）</h3><p>看<strong>套筒刻度</strong>，数出被<strong>微分筒边缘露出来</strong>的整毫米（或 0.025″）刻线。特别留意<strong>半毫米刻线</strong>（公制）— 如果它露出来了，读数要加 0.5 mm。</p><p><strong>公制：</strong>MSR = 整毫米数 +（半毫米刻线可见则加 0.5）。<br><strong>英制：</strong>MSR = 露出的 0.025″ 刻线数。</p>",
  "Step 2: CSR": "第 2 步：CSR",
  "Circular Scale Reading": "微分筒读数",
  "<h3>Step 2 — Circular Scale Reading (CSR)</h3><p>Find the thimble division that aligns with the <strong>datum (reference) line</strong> on the barrel. This is the CSR.</p><p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Zoom to magnify the reading area. In this simulator, the aligned division is clearly visible where the thimble edge meets the barrel.</p>": "<h3>第 2 步 — 微分筒读数（CSR）</h3><p>找出与套筒上<strong>基准线</strong>对齐的那一格微分筒分度，那就是 CSR。</p><p><strong>提示：</strong>用放大功能放大读数区域。本模拟器里，微分筒边缘与套筒相交处那条对齐的刻线看得很清楚。</p>",
  "Step 3: Calculate": "第 3 步：计算",
  "TR = MSR + CSR × LC": "TR = MSR + CSR × LC",
  "<h3>Step 3 — Calculate Total Reading</h3><div class=\"formula-box\">TR = MSR + (CSR × LC)</div><p><strong>SI:</strong> MSR = 5.50, CSR = 23 → TR = 5.50 + 0.23 = <strong>5.73 mm</strong></p><p><strong>Imperial:</strong> MSR = 0.275″, CSR = 14 → TR = 0.275 + 0.014 = <strong>0.289″</strong></p>": "<h3>第 3 步 — 计算总读数</h3><div class=\"formula-box\">TR = MSR + (CSR × LC)</div><p><strong>公制：</strong>MSR = 5.50，CSR = 23 → TR = 5.50 + 0.23 = <strong>5.73 mm</strong></p><p><strong>英制：</strong>MSR = 0.275″，CSR = 14 → TR = 0.275 + 0.014 = <strong>0.289″</strong></p>",
  "Common Errors": "常见错误",
  "Mistakes to avoid": "要避免的失误",
  "<h3>Common Reading Errors</h3><ul><li><strong>Missing the half-mm mark:</strong> The most common error — causes a 0.50 mm mistake. Always check if the half-mm line is visible.</li><li><strong>Parallax error:</strong> Reading the thimble at an angle. Look straight at the datum line.</li><li><strong>Over-tightening:</strong> Always use the ratchet stop to apply consistent force.</li><li><strong>Ignoring zero error:</strong> Check and correct before every measurement session.</li><li><strong>Wrong thimble division:</strong> Read the division aligned with the datum, not the nearest number.</li></ul>": "<h3>常见读数错误</h3><ul><li><strong>漏看半毫米刻线：</strong>最常见的错误 — 直接差 0.50 mm。每次都要确认半毫米线有没有露出来。</li><li><strong>视差：</strong>斜着看微分筒。要正对基准线看。</li><li><strong>夹得过紧：</strong>始终用棘轮施加一致的测量力。</li><li><strong>忽略零误差：</strong>每次测量前都要检查并修正。</li><li><strong>微分筒格数取错：</strong>要读与基准线对齐的那一格，不是最接近的那个数字。</li></ul>",
  "Parts of a Depth Micrometer": "深度千分尺的组成部件",
  "Parts of an Inside Micrometer": "内径千分尺的组成部件",
  "Parts of a Micrometer Screw Gauge": "外径千分尺的组成部件",
  "Labelled diagram of ": "标注图：",
  "a depth micrometer showing its nine main parts": "深度千分尺的九个主要部件",
  "a caliper-type inside micrometer showing its eight main parts": "卡尺式内径千分尺的八个主要部件",
  "a micrometer screw gauge showing its ten main parts": "外径千分尺的十个主要部件"
}